## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Build test: `npx expo run:android` to compile native module.
- Parser test: Run parsing rules on sample Nigerian bank alerts to verify transaction data extraction.

### Manual Verification
- Verify permission prompts on Android startup.
- Validate that mock/real SMS triggers BroadcastReceiver, inserts to WatermelonDB, and persists across restarts.
- Verify deduplication blocks duplicate transactions when identical SMS is received.
- Verify Gmail OAuth login works and returns valid accessToken on device.
- Confirm token is stored in Keychain and persists across app restart.
- Execute a manual pollNewEmails() call and confirm at least one email is fetched, parsed, converted to transaction, stored in WatermelonDB, and rendered in UI.
